- AB, Ab, aB, ab

- [Aa]{color=red}Bb

- [A]{color=red}b

- [a]{color=red}B

- [A]{color=red}B

- [a]{color=red}b

- Genes independently assort
  - each gamete will have one allele for each gene
  - one A and one B
- Separation\: You CANNOT have two alleles from the same gene in a gamete!!

